"Maradoc was once named Maradox."
"In his mortal life Maradoc was the scout of Emeric's band."
"Maradoc calls Maranor his last living relative, yet he unbound his fate from hers."
"One alcove of the House of Many Gates opens onto Earth."
"In the House of Many Gates a man reads a book without end."
"Maradoc shatters the soul of anyone who breaks an oath of silence on the gods' secret."
"Maradoc and Neriad razed the old gods' temple in the lone mountain long ago."
"Maradoc laughed when Viviane prayed to him for a safe journey."
"Maradoc shared Viviane's memories of her old world with Nous."
"Maradoc put knowledge into the mind of the golem Solfis without asking."
"Maradoc gave Viviane the spell Annihilate."
